<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs $2.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs $2.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $2.00 lower. Top $56.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    230-260 lbs    55.00-56.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-270 lbs    54.00-55.00</p>
<p>	    270-280 lbs    53.00-54.00</p>
<p>Sows steady to 1.00 higher. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-500 lbs    41.00-44.00</p>
<p>	   over 500 lbs    45.00-50.00</p>
</text>
